    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Penguins are amazing birds that can live on lands of snow and ice. Their feet are often very cold, but they don’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "freeze",
            "ref": "v-freeze"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Penguins need to have bare feet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Penguins’ bodies stay warm because of their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fat",
            "zh": "脂肪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "feathers",
            "zh": "羽毛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But their feet are bare. They need them to walk without "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "slipping",
            "zh": "滑倒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and to help them to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "steer",
            "zh": "控制方向"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when they swim."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Penguins can control how warm their feet get."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When penguins feel cold, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "arteries",
            "zh": "动脉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in their legs "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "allow",
            "ref": "v-allow"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " less "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blood",
            "ref": "v-blood"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to flow to their feet. This helps to keep their bodies warm. When they are too warm, the arteries allow more blood to flow to their feet, cooling them off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Penguins have other ways to keep their feet warm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Penguins can "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hunch",
            "zh": "蜷缩"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " down to keep their feet warm. Their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bellies",
            "zh": "腹部"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and feathers will cover their feet. They can also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rock",
            "ref": "v-rock"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " themselves backwards and sit on their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tails",
            "ref": "v-tail"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They do this for a while to get their feet off the cold ice."
          }
        ]
      },
